PHASE 4 - FIX OVERLAPS AND FALSE POSITIVES (behaviour changes, one at a time)

For each approved item in OVERLAPS.md, in the order I give:
  1. Write the failing fixture first (neg_ for a false positive, edge_ for an
     overlap where only the winner may fire). Show it failing.
  2. Apply the approved fix: merge, exclusive_with + precedence, or move the
     shared analysis into facts.py (a facts change is a core change: say so,
     and every rule's fixtures must still pass).
  3. Bump the version of every rule whose behaviour changed.
  4. tools/check.py <IDS involved>. The baseline diff may move ONLY those
     rules. Show 5 sample rows from out/diff.csv per rule.
  5. Wait for my review. After approval: --accept the baseline, commit.

